    Two spider ladder manifolds shoot steam straight down onto all 36 wheels simultaneously ·
    2 × 1 inch steam inlet pipes upgraded from 3/4 inch ·
    Aegis Boiler Mark 1 fully carried forward — domed cube SS 304 · 14cm outer / 12cm inner / 1cm walls · four outward locomotive domes ·
    hemispherical copper bowl 10cm diameter · dome rivets · TIG welded curved corner trim · 300 PSI EWI mist injector · check valve · dual standpipe steam outlets · steam trap · piston exhaust PCW valves · expansion buffer · Halloween steam whistle · 10 gallon poly tank · dual stage filtration — all unchanged ·
