    Target — <strong>1,200 HP at 500 PSI · 10,000+ RPM · 200+ MPH</strong>.
  </p>
  <div class="delta-box">
    PHASE 25 — LAMBORGHINI ENKIDU RSR — KEY DIFFERENCES FROM MIASMA DECKER PHASE 24
