    <div class="metric"><div class="val" style="color:#39a84a">2</div><div class="lbl">Spider Manifolds</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="val" style="color:#00bfff">1"</div><div class="lbl">Steam Inlet Pipes</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="val" style="color:#e8a020">10,000+</div><div class="lbl">RPM Target</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="val" style="color:#e8a020">~1,200</div><div class="lbl">HP at 500 PSI</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="val" style="color:var(--safe)">~20,000</div><div class="lbl">Nm Peak Torque Est.</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="val" style="color:#ff4500">SERP</div><div class="lbl">Chain Belt Output</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#9b59b6"></div>Pelton wheel cylinders — 8 inch dia — 6 per shaft — Inconel 718</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#39a84a"></div>Spider ladder manifolds × 2 — top + middle — steam shoots down</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#00bfff"></div>1 inch steam inlet pipes — upgraded from 3/4 inch</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#ff4500"></div>Serpentine chain belt — combines all 6 shaft outputs</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:#8B6914"></div>Bevel gear 90° turn — output to transmission</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:var(--elec)"></div>No reciprocating mass — pure rotation — 10,000+ RPM</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:var(--aegis)"></div>Aegis Boiler Mark 1 — steam source unchanged</div>
    <div class="leg-item"><div class="leg-dot" style="background:var(--new)"></div>Mid engine rear layout — Lamborghini Enkidu RSR chassis</div>
  </div>

  <text class="schem"></text>
  <svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 1400 820" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
